  "interpretation": "The submitted configuration grows 200 trees to unbounded depth, giving a 1.5 MB forest and 6.34 ms per single-flow decision. Bounding the depth costs 0.0009 macro F1 and returns a 2x latency reduction with a 10x smaller model, which is the difference between a detector that fits comfortably inside a controller process and one that does not. The default was never a design decision and reporting the frontier rather than a single point lets an operator make it one."
